=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7e63ba9bc798731c9c22484d0f9b4b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3d234415/uploads/origins/0c74eb04-2a06-4ce0-b525-4b36ea3c3a11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7e63ba9bc798731c9c22484d0f9b4b9, https://si.imgix.net/3d234415/uploads/origins/0c74eb04-2a06-4ce0-b525-4b36ea3c3a11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99eb54e67066d37a48fecea6cc7baf6e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3d234415/uploads/origins/0c74eb04-2a06-4ce0-b525-4b36ea3c3a11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=020c892b56595eedea58a734c32ed46e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "The theme I want drawn is tall women with BLACK HAIR, PALE SKIN. There are 2 women who are half-cousins, the eyepatch girl Han Hye-min: https://skeb.jp/@SOD_073294/works/8 , and the elegant Mika Mercer: https://skeb.jp/@nisikiyuno/works/4 . The two look very much alike, even though Hye-min is half Korean.\nHye-min is dressed like a gangster like this: https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GCoAfXIWIAAv1j2?format=jpg&name=large , and she is 176 cm with eerie pale skin.\nMika is dressed like an emo or goth with long sleeves, dark colors, a cross choker, and cross earrings. Her design is up to you! She is 175 cm and is VERY flat (AAA Cup), and is skinnier (She's 53 kg, Hye-min is 58 kg). Her eyes are also tsurime narrow eyes (Give her a squint, she has bad eyes), and her hair is a hime cut.\nThe 2 are looking at each other and both thinking, \"彼女は私に似ている！\"\nThe differences between them are their hairstyles, and their chest size. But make them look very similar and sexy!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aktnhino920/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b98cd5d3/uploads/origins/ac764fe6-1614-43ba-9025-f15c57358523?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2931bad8120055de6fd881ca30e81c92", "