iles.\nHer signature colors are steel and purple.\nShe can be found at https://imgchest.com/p/9249w5vmynk\n\nPlease consider her!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aktnhino920/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/05f76f6c/uploads/origins/4d42b161-a6fb-492f-84f1-9e06a460b814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=158612d0359fac86e8df243c8655bffd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/05f76f6c/uploads/origins/4d42b161-a6fb-492f-84f1-9e06a460b814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=158612d0359fac86e8df243c8655bffd, https://si.imgix.net/05f76f6c/uploads/origins/4d42b161-a6fb-492f-84f1-9e06a460b814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e6e4f5d902fef9af79c4d034f186cad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/05f76f6c/uploads/origins/4d42b161-a6fb-492f-84f1-9e06a460b814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a74c4ee7f5ad5f1b9afd88f17f97a18 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I am looking for a drawing of my character \"Onyx\"!\n\nCould you please draw a picture of my character \"Onyx\"?\nShe is a big-breasted, dominant dragon girl.\nShe has sharp teeth and a smirk on her face.\n\nhttps://imgchest.com/p/9p4n3azb7nq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aktnhino920/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/45e76961/uploads/origins/e8a00571-e073-4738-8266-5466d1b66baa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c738eb67215e62285d848c3b1896f3aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/45e76961/uploads/origins/e8a00571-e073-4738-8266-5466d1b66baa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c738eb67215e62285d848c3b1896f3aa, https://si.imgix.net/45e76961/uploads/origins/e8a00571-e073-4738-8266-5466d1b66baa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da187e41179a235e8208168c2477277